<title>USA: US FCC delays airwave sale for video/data services.</title>
<headline>US FCC delays airwave sale for video/data services.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Communications Commission said Thursday it postponed a spectrum auction planned for next month of interactive video and data service licenses.</p>
<p>The agency said it had delayed the so-called IVDS auction to consider requests by bidders and existing license holders who want added flexibility for the service.</p>
<p>The auction of 981 licenses was scheduled for February 18. The FCC did not give a new auction date.</p>
</text>
